OL,3,GNEWSAAmputee, nine, tells Catherine of
OL,4,AThree Peaks success
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nine-year-old amputee who completed
OL,7,Fthe Three Peaks challenge alongside his
OL,8,Fdad has met Catherine, Princess of
OL,9,FWales to celebrate his success.
OL,11,FAlbie-Junior Thomas, from Holywell,
OL,12,FFlintshire, was invited for a tea party
OL,13,Fat Windsor Castle after his father sent
OL,14,Fa letter describing how he had climbed
OL,15,Fthe highest mountains in Wales,
OL,16,FScotland and England.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
