OL,3,GNEWSAAmputee, nine, tells Catherine of
OL,4,AThree Peaks success
OL,5,
OL,6,FDad Daniel said he thought the message
OL,7,Fwould resonate with the princess, after
OL,8,Fshe completed her own Three Peaks
OL,9,Fchallenge earlier this year, in aid of
OL,10,Fthe hospital where she was treated for
OL,11,Fcancer.
OL,13,FIn a post on X, the princess said it
OL,14,Fwas a "pleasure" to hear the stories of
OL,15,F"resilience, determination and hope"
OL,16,Fshared by each person she met.
